sequenceDiagram
    participant Runtime
    participant Backend
    participant Session as BackendSession
    Runtime->>Backend: prepare(policy, sandbox_id)
    Backend-->>Runtime: session (or SandboxCapabilityError)
    Runtime->>Session: create_boundary(request, ids, register)
    Session-->>Runtime: register(boundary), then return it
    Runtime->>Session: start_boundary(boundary, request)
    Session-->>Runtime: client process with pipes
    Note over Runtime: drain stdout/stderr, write stdin
    Runtime->>Session: workload_exited(boundary)
    Runtime->>Session: exit_code(boundary, client code)
    Runtime->>Session: terminate(boundary, policy, force)
    Session-->>Runtime: TerminationReport
    Runtime->>Session: close() once, after all boundaries
